// Pre-Technical Studies Grade 8 depth pass (18 Nov 2026). The first pass (13 Nov) gave every misconception one stock cause, many
// examples whose wrong answer no learner would pick ("A broken door" as a marketing tool, "Making cups" from reinforced concrete),
// one example with its answers swapped (the border of a drawing sheet) and one that taught a wrong rule (a unit after every
// dimension; drawings give the unit once, in a note). Each now has a real error, a believable wrong answer, the learner's reason and
// a repair. Seven knowledge skills cover the practical outcomes that had none (extinguish fires, construct combined shapes, draw to
// scale, create visual programs, use cutting tools, prepare financial statements, prepare a budget); the making is marked with the
// KICD rubric. Prerequisites reach Grade 7 Pre-Technical, Grade 7 Mathematics and Integrated Science skills. Safety lines carry
// SAFETY in their source. Merged by scripts/build-pretechnical-grade.mjs 8. Draft until a Pre-Technical Studies teacher reviews it.
